<title>USA: U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. barley major sales activity in the week ended Sept 26 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:     1996/97		 1997/98</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia   32,500		    Nil</p>
<p>Sales of 33,200 tonnes were 32 pecent above the previous week.</p>
<p>Exports of 24,800 tonnes were down 59 percent from the previous week and 31 percent below the four-week average.</p>
<p>Israel was the major export destination.</p>
</text>
